provenance.prompt:
Create one original transparent RGBA spritesheet of fifteen full-body right-facing Moxie Capwell dunk-360 poses, exactly 5 columns x 3 rows, strict row-major. Use supplied Moxie canon refs: adult human woman, pale skin and lavender-purple eyes, long thick lavender high ponytail with small gold hair tie, athletic mature anatomy, purple/silver basketball uniform with white side panels, wristbands and purple high-tops. Consistent face, body and uniform in every view.

Clean crisp readable 1990s arcade basketball pixel-cel art. Exact 1536x1024, fifteen separate complete figures, one centered per cell with transparent gaps/margins, never crop or touch canvas edges. True-transparent RGBA. Moxie alone. The basketball is a separate game object and is never drawn. No hoop/rim/net, opponent, court, floor, shadows, background, effects, glow, labels, text.

A one-handed 360 dunk with a full 360-degree airborne body turn. Make body orientation clearly progress across each view while keeping hair and uniform recognizable:
0 run-in facing right;
1 gather and turn shoulders;
2 takeoff tick4;
3 airborne three-quarter front;
4 rotate to side view;
5 back view, ponytail trails with spin;
6 three-quarter back;
7 face turns away while knees tuck;
8 reach overhead as rotation continues;
9 three-quarter front returns;
10 face/front view, nearing a full rotation at peak tick14;
11 extend right hand to imaginary rim;
12 release at tick21 after completing the 360;
13 scoring finish tick23 and begin descending;
14 land oriented right, knees flex, recovery.
Keep the left arm extended for balance and anatomy correct. No ball, hoop or background drawn.
